## 📁 Project Structure

```
geometrydash/
├── src/
│   └── geometrydash/
│       ├── __init__.py
│       ├── __main__.py   ← entry point
│       └── game.py       ← ALL the game code lives here
├── pyproject.toml        ← dependencies (pygame)
└── README.md
```

